-- Tests for Decision 2 (Articles 9(2)-(3), 81(3), 83(2)(a), 87(5)) and Decision 3 (Articles
-- 9(10), 39(6), 40, 43(2)(c), 88). Expected values are read from the cited source lines, never
-- from the rules. "977+978 src N" is line N of the file of gazette issue 977+978.

§ `Tests — alcohol, registration, service life`

§§ `Decision 2 — alcohol, drugs and stimulants (977+978 src 238-241; src 1760-1765, 1818-1824, 1934-1936)`

-- Article 9(2): the Law permits no alcohol at all (977+978 src 238-239).
#ASSERT `the permitted level of alcohol under the Law` EQUALS 0
-- No alcohol found: nothing is exceeded.
#ASSERT NOT `Decision 2 — the test` (`a test of` `breath` `finding` 0 `, endogenous` NOTHING `, prohibited drug` FALSE) `exceeds the permitted level, on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Decision 2 — the test` (`a test of` `blood` `finding` 0 `, endogenous` NOTHING `, prohibited drug` FALSE) `exceeds the permitted level, on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
-- Any alcohol in the breath, however little: exceeded (9(2) names breath; 87(5) gives breath no endogenous route).
#ASSERT `Decision 2 — the test` (`a test of` `breath` `finding` 0.01 `, endogenous` NOTHING `, prohibited drug` FALSE) `exceeds the permitted level, on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT `Decision 2 — the test` (`a test of` `breath` `finding` 0.1 `, endogenous` (JUST TRUE) `, prohibited drug` FALSE) `exceeds the permitted level, on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
-- Alcohol in the blood: exceeded unless the Ministry of Health's method found it endogenous (src 1936; forks F8, F28, F29).
#ASSERT NOT `Decision 2 — the test` (`a test of` `blood` `finding` 12 `, endogenous` (JUST TRUE) `, prohibited drug` FALSE) `exceeds the permitted level, on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT `Decision 2 — the test` (`a test of` `blood` `finding` 12 `, endogenous` (JUST FALSE) `, prohibited drug` FALSE) `exceeds the permitted level, on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT `Decision 2 — the test` (`a test of` `blood` `finding` 12 `, endogenous` NOTHING `, prohibited drug` FALSE) `exceeds the permitted level, on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
-- Article 9(2) itself gives the same answers.
#ASSERT `Article 9(2) — the test` (`a test of` `breath` `finding` 0.01 `, endogenous` NOTHING `, prohibited drug` FALSE) `shows driving with alcohol in the blood or breath, on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 9(2) — the test` (`a test of` `blood` `finding` 12 `, endogenous` (JUST TRUE) `, prohibited drug` FALSE) `shows driving with alcohol in the blood or breath, on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
-- Before 1 January 2025 (Article 88).
#ASSERT REFUSED `Decision 2 — the test` (`a test of` `breath` `finding` 0 `, endogenous` NOTHING `, prohibited drug` FALSE) `exceeds the permitted level, on` (YMD 2024 12 31) BECAUSE "the Road Traffic Law 23/2008/QH12 governs a day before 1 January 2025, and it is not in the sources"
-- Drugs and stimulants: any in the body (977+978 src 240-241; src 1822-1824).
#ASSERT `Decision 2 — the test` (`a test of` `blood` `finding` 0 `, endogenous` NOTHING `, prohibited drug` TRUE) `found a prohibited narcotic or stimulant, on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Decision 2 — the test` (`a test of` `blood` `finding` 0 `, endogenous` NOTHING `, prohibited drug` FALSE) `found a prohibited narcotic or stimulant, on` (YMD 2026 3 1)

§§ `Article 40 — service life (src 500-517)`

-- (3)(a): a passenger car for up to 8 persons has no service life, however old (src 514).
#ASSERT `Article 40(1) — the last day of the service life of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 8 `seats,` 2500 `kg gross,` 600 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 1990 `, life ending` NOTHING `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT `Article 40 — the vehicle` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 8 `seats,` 2500 `kg gross,` 600 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 1990 `, life ending` NOTHING `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) `is past its service life on` (YMD 2026 1 1)
-- A 9-seat car has one; with no year supplied, Article 40(4) leaves it to the Government (src 517).
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 40 — the vehicle` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 9 `seats,` 3500 `kg gross,` 700 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2005 `, life ending` NOTHING `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) `is past its service life on` (YMD 2026 1 1) BECAUSE "Article 40(4) leaves the service life of each kind to the Government, whose rules are not in the sources, and the year it ends was not supplied"
-- (3)(a): motorcycles, mopeds, special-use automobiles, trailers, semi-trailers.
#ASSERT `Article 40(1) — the last day of the service life of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`a petrol vehicle on` 2 `wheels, of` 125 `cm3, designed for` 100 `km/h, kerb mass` 120) `, made in` 1980 `, life ending` NOTHING `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Article 40(1) — the last day of the service life of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `a special function` `with` 2 `seats,` 12000 `kg gross,` 3000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 1980 `, life ending` NOTHING `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Article 40(1) — the last day of the service life of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`a towed vehicle of` 30000 `kg gross, resting partly on the towing vehicle` TRUE `, special-use kind` NOTHING) `, made in` 1980 `, life ending` NOTHING `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3)(b): a military vehicle for defence has none (src 516).
#ASSERT `Article 40(1) — the last day of the service life of` (`registered` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 1980 `, life ending` NOTHING `, before conversion` NOTHING `, ending` NOTHING `, military` TRUE `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Article 40 speaks of motor vehicles; a tractor is a special-use machine (src 298, 500).
#ASSERT `Article 40(1) — the last day of the service life of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`a tractor with payload in kg` 2000) `, made in` 1980 `, life ending` NOTHING `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (1): a truck whose service life ends in 2025 runs to the end of 31 December 2025 (src 501-502).
#ASSERT `Article 40(1) — the last day of the service life of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2000 `, life ending` (JUST 2025) `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2025 12 31)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 40 — the vehicle` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2000 `, life ending` (JUST 2025) `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) `is past its service life on` (YMD 2025 12 31)
#ASSERT `Article 40 — the vehicle` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2000 `, life ending` (JUST 2025) `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) `is past its service life on` (YMD 2026 1 1)
-- Decree 67 Article 9(1)(b): less than a year left. Life ending 2030: on 1 January 2030 yes; on 31 December 2029 no.
#ASSERT `Article 40 — less than a year of service life is left to` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 16 `seats,` 4500 `kg gross,` 1200 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2010 `, life ending` (JUST 2030) `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) `on` (YMD 2030 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 40 — less than a year of service life is left to` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 16 `seats,` 4500 `kg gross,` 1200 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2010 `, life ending` (JUST 2030) `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) `on` (YMD 2029 12 31)
-- (2)(a): a truck converted into a special-use automobile keeps the truck's service life (src 504-505).
#ASSERT `Article 40 — the service-life rule that governs` (`registered` (`an automobile for` `a special function` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 3000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2000 `, life ending` NOTHING `, before conversion` (JUST (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING)) `, ending` (JUST 2025) `, military` FALSE `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) EQUALS `the rule for the vehicle before conversion`
#ASSERT `Article 40 — the vehicle` (`registered` (`an automobile for` `a special function` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 3000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2000 `, life ending` NOTHING `, before conversion` (JUST (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING)) `, ending` (JUST 2025) `, military` FALSE `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) `is past its service life on` (YMD 2026 1 1)
-- (2)(b): an 8-seat car converted into a truck takes the truck's rule (src 506-507).
#ASSERT `Article 40 — the service-life rule that governs` (`registered` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 3000 `kg gross,` 1000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2010 `, life ending` (JUST 2035) `, before conversion` (JUST (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 8 `seats,` 2500 `kg gross,` 600 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING)) `, ending` NOTHING `, military` FALSE `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) EQUALS `the rule for its present kind`
-- (2)(c): a 16-seat car converted into a truck takes the truck's rule (src 508-512).
#ASSERT `Article 40 — the service-life rule that governs` (`registered` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 4500 `kg gross,` 1500 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2010 `, life ending` (JUST 2035) `, before conversion` (JUST (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 16 `seats,` 4500 `kg gross,` 1200 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING)) `, ending` (JUST 2030) `, military` FALSE `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) EQUALS `the rule for its present kind`
#ASSERT NOT `Article 40 — the vehicle` (`registered` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 4500 `kg gross,` 1500 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2010 `, life ending` (JUST 2035) `, before conversion` (JUST (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 16 `seats,` 4500 `kg gross,` 1200 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING)) `, ending` (JUST 2030) `, military` FALSE `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) `is past its service life on` (YMD 2031 1 1)
-- Neither before nor after has a service life: none.
#ASSERT `Article 40 — the service-life rule that governs` (`registered` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2010 `, life ending` NOTHING `, before conversion` (JUST (`an automobile for` `a special function` `with` 2 `seats,` 2500 `kg gross,` 500 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING)) `, ending` NOTHING `, military` FALSE `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) EQUALS `no service life`

§§ `Article 9(10) — conversions into passenger automobiles (977+978 src 258-259)`

-- A truck converted into a 16-seat automobile: prohibited; for defence or security: not.
#ASSERT `Article 9(10) — prohibits the conversion of` (`registered` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 16 `seats,` 4500 `kg gross,` 1200 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2010 `, life ending` (JUST 2030) `, before conversion` (JUST (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 4500 `kg gross,` 1500 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING)) `, ending` (JUST 2035) `, military` FALSE `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 9(10) — prohibits the conversion of` (`registered` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 16 `seats,` 4500 `kg gross,` 1200 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2010 `, life ending` (JUST 2030) `, before conversion` (JUST (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 4500 `kg gross,` 1500 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING)) `, ending` (JUST 2035) `, military` TRUE `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`)
-- The other way, a 16-seat automobile converted into a truck: not prohibited (40(2)(c) provides for it).
#ASSERT NOT `Article 9(10) — prohibits the conversion of` (`registered` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 4500 `kg gross,` 1500 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2010 `, life ending` (JUST 2035) `, before conversion` (JUST (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 16 `seats,` 4500 `kg gross,` 1200 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING)) `, ending` (JUST 2030) `, military` FALSE `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`)
-- A vehicle never converted.
#ASSERT NOT `Article 9(10) — prohibits the conversion of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 16 `seats,` 4500 `kg gross,` 1200 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2010 `, life ending` (JUST 2030) `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`)

§§ `Article 35(1) and Article 9(8) (src 311-318; 977+978 src 253-255)`

-- 35(1): registered and plated, and inspected; a revoked certificate no longer counts.
#ASSERT `Article 35(1) — the vehicle` (`the papers of` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE) `, registered and plated` TRUE `, inspected` TRUE) `meets the conditions Article 35(1) sets, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 35(1) — the vehicle` (`the papers of` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE) `, registered and plated` TRUE `, inspected` FALSE) `meets the conditions Article 35(1) sets, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 35(1) — the vehicle` (`the papers of` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE) `, registered and plated` FALSE `, inspected` TRUE) `meets the conditions Article 35(1) sets, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 35(1) — the vehicle` (`the papers of` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE) `, registered and plated` TRUE `, inspected` TRUE) `meets the conditions Article 35(1) sets, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT `Article 35(1) — the vehicle` (`the papers of` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` (JUST (YMD 2026 7 1)) `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE) `, registered and plated` TRUE `, inspected` TRUE) `meets the conditions Article 35(1) sets, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- 35(1) sets no condition for a rudimentary vehicle.
#ASSERT `Article 35(1) — the vehicle` (`the papers of` (`a bicycle moved by` `human power, through pedals or a hand crank`) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE) `, registered and plated` FALSE `, inspected` FALSE) `meets the conditions Article 35(1) sets, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- 9(8): an uninspected car or tractor in traffic is prohibited; an unregistered but inspected car is not, under 9(8) (fork F30).
#ASSERT `Article 9(8) — putting the vehicle` (`the papers of` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE) `, registered and plated` TRUE `, inspected` FALSE) `in road traffic is prohibited, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 9(8) — putting the vehicle` (`the papers of` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE) `, registered and plated` TRUE `, inspected` TRUE) `in road traffic is prohibited, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 9(8) — putting the vehicle` (`the papers of` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE) `, registered and plated` FALSE `, inspected` TRUE) `in road traffic is prohibited, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT `Article 9(8) — putting the vehicle` (`the papers of` (`a tractor with payload in kg` 2000) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE) `, registered and plated` TRUE `, inspected` FALSE) `in road traffic is prohibited, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- A rudimentary vehicle's conditions are the Government's (35(5)); an earlier day is the 2008 Law's.
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 9(8) — putting the vehicle` (`the papers of` (`a bicycle moved by` `human power, through pedals or a hand crank`) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE) `, registered and plated` TRUE `, inspected` TRUE) `in road traffic is prohibited, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) BECAUSE "the conditions for a rudimentary vehicle in road traffic are the Government's (Article 35(5)), and are not in the sources"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 9(8) — putting the vehicle` (`the papers of` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE) `, registered and plated` TRUE `, inspected` FALSE) `in road traffic is prohibited, on` (YMD 2024 12 31) BECAUSE "the Road Traffic Law 23/2008/QH12 governs a day before 1 January 2025, and it is not in the sources"

§§ `Article 39(6), Article 43(2)(c) and Decision 3 (src 478-496, 630-632)`

-- Revocation of the certificate, from its date (Decree 67 Article 11 counts from it).
#ASSERT `Decision 3 — the registration or plate of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2015 `, life ending` (JUST 2040) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) `, plate revoked` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) `, ownership transferred` TRUE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE)) `has been revoked, or it is past its service life, on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Decision 3 — the registration or plate of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2015 `, life ending` (JUST 2040) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) `, plate revoked` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) `, ownership transferred` TRUE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE)) `has been revoked, or it is past its service life, on` (YMD 2026 2 28)
-- The plate alone revoked.
#ASSERT `Decision 3 — the registration or plate of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2015 `, life ending` NOTHING `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE)) `has been revoked, or it is past its service life, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- Past its service life, not revoked: TRUE on 1 January 2026 for a life ending 2025.
#ASSERT `Decision 3 — the registration or plate of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2000 `, life ending` (JUST 2025) `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) `has been revoked, or it is past its service life, on` (YMD 2026 1 1)
-- A revoked registration is answered from the record even before 2025; the service life is not.
#ASSERT `Decision 3 — the registration or plate of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2000 `, life ending` (JUST 2025) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` (JUST (YMD 2024 6 1)) `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` TRUE)) `has been revoked, or it is past its service life, on` (YMD 2024 12 1)
#ASSERT REFUSED `Decision 3 — the registration or plate of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2000 `, life ending` (JUST 2025) `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) `has been revoked, or it is past its service life, on` (YMD 2024 12 1) BECAUSE "the Road Traffic Law 23/2008/QH12 governs a day before 1 January 2025, and it is not in the sources"
-- 39(6)(a): a transfer revokes the certificate and the plate; with an auctioned plate, only the certificate (src 480-481).
#ASSERT `Article 39(6)(a) — the transfer revokes the plate as well as the certificate` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` TRUE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 39(6)(a) — the transfer revokes the plate as well as the certificate` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` TRUE `, auction plate` TRUE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE)
-- 39(6)(d): the end of the service life and damage beyond use are both cases (src 490).
#ASSERT `Article 39(6) — the cases for revocation that have arisen for` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2000 `, life ending` (JUST 2025) `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` NOTHING `, plate revoked` NOTHING `, ownership transferred` FALSE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` TRUE)) `on` (YMD 2026 1 1) EQUALS LIST `(d) the end of the service life`, `(d) damage beyond use`
#ASSERT null (`Article 39(6) — the cases for revocation that have arisen for` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2000 `, life ending` (JUST 2025) `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) `on` (YMD 2025 12 31))
-- 43(2)(c): sold, not yet revoked: the registered owner keeps the owner's responsibility; once revoked, not (src 630-632).
#ASSERT `Article 43(2)(c) — the person named in the registration of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2015 `, life ending` NOTHING `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) `, plate revoked` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) `, ownership transferred` TRUE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE)) `keeps the owner's responsibility on` (YMD 2026 2 28)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 43(2)(c) — the person named in the registration of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2015 `, life ending` NOTHING `, with` (`a registration with certificate revoked` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) `, plate revoked` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) `, ownership transferred` TRUE `, auction plate` FALSE `, damaged beyond use` FALSE)) `keeps the owner's responsibility on` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 43(2)(c) — the person named in the registration of` (`the civilian vehicle` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `, made in` 2015 `, life ending` NOTHING `, with` `a registration with nothing recorded`) `keeps the owner's responsibility on` (YMD 2026 2 28)
